===Etymology 3===
From the first letter of the word. Suggested in the 1916 ''United States Army Signal Book'' to distinguish the letter when communicating via telephone,<ref>{{cite-book|year=1916|author=United States Army|title=Signal Book|url=https://archive.org/details/SignalBook1916/page/n35|page=33|section=Conventional telephone signals}}</ref> and later adopted in other radio and telephone signal standards.

